2560393,"name":"Andrés Blanco","role":"Médico Hospital","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vCCOdZr1bnUfD63LOvI2AJGhzam.jpg"},{"id":1441201,"name":"Nahia Laiz","role":"Enfermera Clínica Psiquiátrica","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zhPVK93hZjRqDwGCY0EE4uc8gEz.jpg"},{"id":2301927,"name":"Pako Revueltas","role":"Ángel Ostolaza (Carnicero)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mWkMWyUjgG7EvEk001GP1kEXF3s.jpg"},{"id":1788498,"name":"Juanma Navas","role":"Teniente Padua G. Ciivil","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pMuFJ7XMLjDgJllt3AxLza0gi4D.jpg"},{"id":1894224,"name":"Amaruk Kayshapanta","role":"Jason Medina (as Amarouk Caizapanta)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qHj85LNQQbnBjlJ2kHoPHkTRBIs.jpg"},{"id":1795943,"name":"Elvira Arce","role":"Abogada Jason Medina","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eNifC7yjzJyGUaOG8Q9H0jCbpRK.jpg"},{"id":1261487,"name":"Ramón Ibarra","role":"Médico Elizondo","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7EmqhyL3CThKl9j5plXiT9ZnnHz.jpg"},{"id":1474035,"name":"Charly Urbina","role":"Ciudadano Busca Anne Bosque","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qW5Tj7RulNg2WskY1sXGijL6mHS.jpg"},{"id":6469268,"name":"Naroa Capell","role":"Amiga Anne 1"},{"id":2790333,"name":"Ángela Lasheras","role":"Amiga Anne 2 (as Ángela Lashera)"},{"id":6469278,"name":"Haizae Ancin","role":"Amiga Anne 3"},{"id":6469279,"name":"Jorge Tirapu Sola","role":"Locutor Radio"},{"id":6469280,"name":"Marisa Lacabe Román","role":"Locutor Radio"},{"id":6469283,"name":"Hugo Sousa González","role":"El Niño Testigo"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Il guardiano invisibile","overview":"Ai margini del fiume Baztan viene rinvenuto il corpo nudo di una adolescente uccisa in circostanze apparentemente misteriose. Amaia Salazar, ispettrice di polizia, si trasferisce da Pamplona a Elizondo per indagare sul caso. Negli stessi luoghi in cui ha vissuto da bambina e di cui non ha ricordi felici, Amaia scopre con le sue indagini la figura di un serial killer che continua a porre fine alla vita delle sue giovani vittime con un sorprendente modus operandi. La polizia dovrà rintracciarlo prima che possa commettere un ulteriore delitto ma la mitologia della regione del Norte e le sue figure fantastiche sorprenderanno tutti."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Invisible Guardian","overview":"When the naked body of a teenage girl is found on the banks of the River Baztán, it is quickly linked to a similar murder one month before. Soon, rumours are flying in the nearby village of Elizondo. Is this the work of a ritualistic killer or is it the basajaun, the ‘invisible guardian’ of Basque mythology?  Inspector Amaia Salazar leads the investigation, taking her back to the heart of the Basque country where she was born, and where she hoped never to return. Shrouded in mist and surrounded by impenetrable forests, it is a place of unresolved conflicts and a terrible secret from Amaia’s childhood that will come back to haunt her.  Faced with the superstitions of the village, Amaia must fight the demons of her past to confront the reality of a serial killer on the loose. But as she is drawn deeper into the investigation, she feels the presence of something darker lurking in the shadows…"},{"language":"es-ES","title":"El guardián invisible","overview":"En los márgenes del río Baztán, en el valle de Navarra, aparece el cuerpo desnudo de una adolescente en una circunstancia que lo relaciona con un asesinato ocurrido un mes atrás... La inspectora Amaia Salazar dirige la investigación que la llevará de vuelta al pueblo de Elizondo, donde ella creció y del que ha tratado de huir toda su vida. Enfrentada con las complicadas derivaciones del caso y sus propios fantasmas, la investigación de Amaia es una carrera contrarreloj para dar con un implacable asesino, en una tierra fértil en supersticiones y brujería...","tagline":"Descubre los misterios que esconde el valle."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8KL8eyxDTeROvSQYMSCdabMoneC.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/60XJOemSR9LQRDgBMRN7qkdLsPH.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":392207,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8KL8eyxDTeROvSQYMSCdabMoneC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8KL8eyxDTeROvSQYMSCdabMoneC.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8KL8eyxDTeROvSQYMSCdabMoneC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8KL8eyxDTeROvSQYMSCdabMoneC.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yCeerU7HQ6Ib2XR4XgRpOa9zMaL.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yCeerU7HQ6Ib2XR4XgRpOa9zMaL.jpg","language":"it","width":720,"height":1080},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uNq3qw8g3zI7s6PBUBGuMRhqRgw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uNq3qw8g3zI7s6PBUBGuMRhqRgw.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uxR7CqLRdQ2QuOPP9ymunPrRBCq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uxR7CqLRdQ2QuOPP9ymunPrRBCq.jpg","language":"en","width":960,"height":1440},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uxR7CqLRdQ2QuOPP9ymunPrRBCq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uxR7CqLRdQ2QuOPP9ymunPrRBCq.jpg","language":"en","width":960,"height":1440},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6y4HXlFmEKBmzCnKnADsT2c7yNL.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6y4HXlFmEKBmzCnKnADsT2c7yNL.jpg","language":"